<p>ran se jab khake sinaa'n akbar -e- zishaa'n aaye<br />
maa ki qidmat me koi aan ke mehmaa'n aaye<br />
ghar me laashe ko liye shaah -e- shahidaa'n aaye<br />
nouha gar qaak basar chaak garebaa'n aaye</p>

<p>di sada qatl huwe yousuf -e- saani bano<br />
mil gayi qaak me akbar jawani bano<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekhle aaqri deedar pisar marta hai<br />
saamne ankho'n ke ye noor-e- nazar marta hai<br />
ab koi dam me mera rashke qamar marta hai<br />
mu se baahar hai zabaa'n tishna jigar marta hai</p>

<p>dam hai seene me ruka zakhmo'n se khoo'n jaari hai<br />
shahar bano tera ghar lutne ki tayyari hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pahonchi qaime me jo hazrat ko ye purdard sadaa<br />
muztarib hogaye naamoose rasoole dosara<br />
kaha chilla ke sakina ne ke hai hai bhaiyya<br />
fizza doudi sooe dar phaink ke sar par se ridaa</p>

<p>peet'ti zainab -e- muztar nikal aayi baahar<br />
baano ghabra ke khule sar nikal aayi baahar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shah ke kaandhe pa jo dekha ali akbar ko nidhaal<br />
haath phaila ke ye chillayi ke hai hai mere laal<br />
kya ghazab hogaya aye baad-e- shah-e- nek qisaal<br />
raas aaya na mere bacche ko attarwaa'n saal</p>

<p>tukde tegho'n se badan hogaya saara hai hai<br />
koun tha jis ne mere sher ko maara hai hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roke bano se ye farmane lage sarwar-e- dee'n<br />
sar na peeto abhi zinda hai mera maah-e jabee'n<br />
saans aati hai pa har dam hai dame baade pasee'n<br />
kooch inka bhi hai aur ham bhi hai marne ke qaree'n</p>

<p>sab chute ab na raha koi hamara baano<br />
is jawaa'n bete ke gham ne hame maara baano<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sun ke maadar ki sadaa khol diye dida -e- nam<br />
haath utha kar kaha ro-o na mere sar ki qasam<br />
paas aakar hame chaati se lagalo is dam<br />
ran se aaye hai tumhaari hi mulaaqaat ko ham</p>

<p>phir ye ghar shaah ke iqbaal se dekha hamne<br />
par tumhe aake ajab haal se dekha hamne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baal kyu bikhre hai kyu phaink di sar par se rida<br />
neel kyu seeene pa hai kyu hai garebaan phata<br />
qaak kyu mu pa mali ho ye pisar tum pa fida<br />
shaah dunya me salamat rahe ye kya ye kya</p>

<p>lut gayi ye na suqan mu se nikaalo amma<br />
mai to jeeta hoon kaleje ko sambhalo amma<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zaqmi hone ki mere kis ne qabar pohnchaayi<br />
jhoot hai mai ne to hargiz nahi barchi khaayi<br />
aap tak bete ko taqdeer salamat laayi<br />
dekhe hazrat ke qadam tan me mere jaa'n aayi</p>

<p>marg se pahle ho maatam ye zaboo'n hai amma<br />
mere kapdo'n pa to abbas ka qoo'n hai amma<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>boli bano ke jo kehte ho khuda yu'n hi kare<br />
aye mere laal ye maa teri balaa leke mare<br />
laao dho daalu'n mai jo khoon me kapde hai bhare<br />
chaand se haath hai phir kis liye chaati pa dhare</p>

<p>mujh ko maalum huwa qalq se jaate ho tum<br />
mere rone ke liye zaqm chupate ho tum<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bano sadme se na marjaye ye dar hai beta<br />
sab tere dil ki mere dil ko qabar hai beta<br />
haaye seena ye tera khoon me tar hai beta<br />
phir ye kya hai jo nahi zaqme jigar hai beta</p>

<p>san'sanaata hai jigar jaan chali jaati hai<br />
is lahu se to mere doodh ki boo aati hai</p>

<p>____________________________</p>

<p>aarzu hai ke phale phule mera naqle muraad<br />
tum dulhan byaah ke laao mera ghar ho aabaad<br />
dehkh loo'n ankhou'n se apne mai tumhari aulaad<br />
phir mai dunya se jo guzroo'n to rahe rooh bhi shaad</p>

<p>daadi kehlaaungi rutba mera bartar hoga<br />
tera farzand bhi hamshakl -e- payambar hoga<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aah ki sun ke ye akbar ne basad ranj-o- malaal<br />
dard chaati me utha ghair huwa aur bhi haal<br />
dil me ye soch ke rone laga wo nek qisaal<br />
ham safar karte hai amma ko hai shaadi ka qayaal</p>

<p>bar me hoyega kafan qaak pa chehra hoga<br />
naa dulhan hogi na aulaad na sehra hoga<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>